  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 525.02 Approval Criteria for Restoration/Enhancement Activities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 525.02 Approval Criteria for Restoration/Enhancement Activities. In addition to meeting the criteria established in Env-Wt 300, the department shall not approve an application for a restoration/ enhancement project unless the project:\n\n(a) Meets the design and construction requirements specified in Env-Wt 525.04; and\n\n(b) Does not include unnatural stream channelization or conversion of wetlands to uplands.\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt500.html"
}
